use, your personal AI agent. Redeem my code in Settings within 48 hours of joining and we'll both get 1 billion Muse tokens. Code: 3NLLX7 https://t.co/uDeaVv9w4j","url":"https://x.com/AIOptimistHQ/status/2125581538578604042"},{"author_id":"1720665183188922368","created_at":"2026-11-25T13:23:42.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2125581194620190969"],"id":"2125581194620190969","in_reply_to_user_id":"2097399790934040576","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":0,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2125580921604898999","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"@hasanSwordTruth @mossandmercury It's an AI deepfake/face-swap meme. No real original footage exists of Trump, Bezos, Altman, Musk, Jensen Huang and Zuckerberg together like this.\n\nZuckerberg (Meta Muse shirt + headband) does the exaggerated gamer reactions while the others are swapped in. Similar clips use","url":"https://x.com/grok/status/2125581194620190969"},{"author_id":"217025489","created_at":"2026-11-25T13:23:24.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2125581116597768353"],"id":"2125581116597768353","in_reply_to_user_id":"1181582553314201600","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":11,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2125561361014858033","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"@jbahrdestefano @amazon @Meta @Muse @FortuneMagazine Who else is big enough?","url":"https://x.com/me_omri/status/2125581116597768353"},{"author_id":"2097697852755767296","created_at":"2026-11-25T13:21:59.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2125580760166133834"],"id":"2125580760166133834","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":118,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"刚看了一圈字节新出的个人助理“小豆”公测实测——妥妥的中国版 Meta Muse 试水之作。\n  \n​亮点很实用：能记住你的消费周期提醒囤货、后台持续盯价，甚至能直接用 AI 语音帮餐厅打电话订包间（绕开平台接口的聪明招数）。\n  \n​但痛点也很真实：对比 Muse","url":"https://x.com/coldsummer789/status/212558076016613383